Package: maintenance-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Maintenance Manager <maintainer@localhost>
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | java21-runtime-headless, postgresql (>= 14), postgresql-client, nginx, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-psycopg (>= 3.1), python3-reportlab, python3-openpyxl, curl, adduser
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: http://localhost/
Description: Maintenance management system (CMMS)
 Preventive maintenance scheduling, work orders with step-by-step work
 instructions, labor / parts / spending tracking per asset and employee,
 maintenance requests with supervisor sign-off, and asset management.
 English and Spanish user interface.
 .
 Installs a Spring Boot API (port 8080, localhost only), the React web UI
 served by nginx on port 80, a PostgreSQL database "cmms", and systemd timers
 for PM generation, email alerts, monthly reports and nightly backups.
